---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About MeepleMath" description="MeepleMath makes free, fast score calculators for modern board games.">
  <article class="prose-mm max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">About MeepleMath</h1>
    <p>
      MeepleMath is a set of free score calculators for modern board games. Each calculator follows the game's own
      score pad, supports the popular expansions and explains the scoring rules in plain English, so that the end of
      a game night is about who won and not about adding up columns.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site works without an account. Saved games and player stats are kept in your own browser, and you can
      install the site on your phone so it works offline at the table.
    </p>
    <h2>Independent fan project</h2>
    <p>
      MeepleMath is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any game publisher. We use game names only to say
      which game a calculator is for. All game names are trademarks of their respective owners.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Spotted a scoring mistake or want a game added? Email
      <a class="font-semibold text-accent underline" href="mailto:hello@meeplemath.org">hello@meeplemath.org</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
